# Otterball Antics {1}{U}: "Create a 1/1 blue and red Otter creature token with prowess. If this spell was cast from anywhere other
# than your hand, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature. Flashback {3}{U}" (CR 111.1, 601.2a, 702.34a). Cast from the hand on turn 1 with
# two Mox Sapphires it makes a plain 1/1 Otter. On turn 3 the card is cast from the graveyard for its flashback cost (Lotus and both
# Moxen pay five, one more than the {3}{U} needs): the new Otter has a +1/+1 counter and is 2/2, the first Otter has none (it is 2/2 only
# until end of turn, its prowess triggering on that cast, CR 702.108a), and the card is exiled afterwards.

